    "long_instructions": "## Wellness Coach\r\n\r\nDesign and test your own mini-app by writing small, reusable functions that update a variable and the page. \r\n\r\n* **Plan it**: Fill in your **Function Plan** in your Activity Guide.\r\n* **Build it**: Write the functions in `script.js` using **arrow notation** and add a one-line **comment** above each function.\r\n* **Wire it up**: Connect each function to a button with `addEventListener`.\r\n* **Test it**: Click your buttons and confirm the change.\r\n* **Refactor if needed**: If you spot 3 similar lines, move them into a reusable function and call it as needed. \r\n* **Score it**: Use your **Scorecard** in your Activity Guide to self-check clarity, naming, and reuse. \r\n* **\r\nUse AI to Help You\r\n* Explain your code line-by-line in plain language.\r\n* Suggest clearer, verb-first names or better comment stems.\r\n* Check math or logic in your formulas.\r\n* Identify repeated steps you could refactor—without writing new code.\r\n* Sanity-check: “Did I define before I call?” “Does each function have one job?”\r\n",
    "display_name": "Wellness Coach",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <title>L4 — Wellness Coach</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <h1>Wellness Coach</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Track your habit streak and boosts.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"container card\">\n    <section class=\"status\">\n      <p class=\"label\">Streak</p>\n      <p id=\"streakDisplay\" class=\"value\">0</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"output-block\">\n      <p id=\"output\" class=\"output\">Ready.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"controls\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Actions</h2>\n      <button id=\"btnLog\" class=\"btn\">Log Habit (+1)</button>\n      <button id=\"btnBreak\" class=\"btn\">Break Streak (0)</button>\n      <button id=\"btnBoost\" class=\"btn\">Boost Streak (+5)</button>\n      <button id=\"btnReset\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Reset</button>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <small>© Wellness Coach</small>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Basic layout */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  background: #f5f7ff;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 20px 12px;\n}\n\n.site-header h1 {\n  margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n.lede {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #64748b;\n}\n\n.container {\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.status {\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.label {\n  color: #64748b;\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n}\n\n.value {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.output-block {\n  margin: 12px 0;\n}\n\n.output {\n  border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fbfdff;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  min-height: 28px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  margin: 14px 0 10px 0;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 6px 6px 0 0;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #eef2ff;\n}\n\n.btn-ghost {\n  background: #f3f4f6;\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 18px 12px;\n  color: #64748b;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// variable for streak\nlet streak = 0;\n\n// references to display elements and buttons\nconst streakDisplay = document.getElementById('streakDisplay');\nconst output = document.getElementById('output');\n\nconst btnLog = document.getElementById('btnLog');\nconst btnBreak = document.getElementById('btnBreak');\nconst btnBoost = document.getElementById('btnBoost');\nconst btnReset = document.getElementById('btnReset');\n\n// Log Habit button\n\n\n// Break Streak button\n\n\n// Boost Streak button\n\n\n// Reset Coach button\n\n\n// initial display\nstreakDisplay.textContent = String(streak);\noutput.textContent      = 'Ready.';",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
